=== COMPREHENSIVE TERNARY OPERATOR TEST ===

-- 1. Basic Boolean Logic --
TRUE ? 10 : 20   => 10
FALSE ? 10 : 20  => 20

-- 2. Comparison Conditions --
50 < 100 ? 'Less' : 'More' => Less
50 > 100 ? 'Less' : 'More' => More

-- 3. Arithmetic inside Branches --
10==10 ? 5+5 : 100*2 => 10

-- 4. Nested Ternaries --
Score 85 Grade => B
Score 40 Grade => C

-- 5. Return Type Flexibility --
TRUE ? 'String' : 12345 => String

-- 6. Precedence & Complex Logic --
(TRUE AND FALSE) ? 'Wrong' : 'Right' => Right
10 + ((5 > 2) ? 5 : 0) => 15

=== TEST COMPLETE ===
